        "slc_9dee117f41a103e491d75c7b62c3c2646f79e974463b0392c25876813f9bb3e8"
      ],
      "text": "An at-a-glance table documents five distinct workflows - PR review, CI review, autofix planning, downstream fork sync, and agent handoff - each with its own input shape and output type."
    },
