        "slc_b67cb5619ad2197fc5c87d7e29fac31601b7ba024e9d246d6b16352047190a63"
      ],
      "text": "A write-model table documents narrow write behavior: the hosted demo is read-only, GitHub App reviews post comment-level PR reviews, and the sync command runs dry-run unless --execute, --push, or --create-pr is explicitly passed."
    },
